      "message": "1. Simply code of ec_cfg_usb_db_type\n2. Due to CL:3095438, mux HPD interface change, follow it to update usb_mux_hpd_update.\n",
      "revId": "65f8612b5bb389b699fdf5be4d6cc9fa5e54d913",
